uggest a few concrete issues or subtasks my team might be missing. Start with a brief overview of your reasoning, then list 3 work items, each with a clear title and one‑line description. Keep response under 300 words.",description:"Prompt for creating new issues quickly for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},breakDownComplexIssuesPrompt:{id:"rovo-chat.creator-prompts.break-down-complex-issues-prompt",defaultMessage:"Identify my team’s most complex work item, and suggest 3 subtasks to track separately. Start with a brief overview of your reasoning, then list 3 subtasks, each with a clear title and one‑line description. Keep response under 300 words.",description:"Prompt for breaking down complex issues for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},makeMyIssuesClearerPrompt:{id:"rovo-chat.creator-prompts.make-my-issues-clearer-prompt",defaultMessage:"Identify an issue that seems unclear, outdated, or hard to act on. Start with a brief overview of your reasoning, then share 3 concrete ideas to help my team improve, progress, or close it quickly and confidently. Keep response under 300 words.",description:"Prompt for making my issues clearer for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},catchupAfterTimeAwayPrompt:{id:"rovo-chat.consumer-prompts.catchup-after-time-away-prompt",defaultMessage:"Based on the work items you can see, give me a high-level summary of what’s changed over the past two weeks. Focus on items that changed, are delayed or blocked, and anything else that needs my attention. Keep response under 300 words.",description:"Prompt for catching up after time away for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},draftHelpfulCommentsOrUpdatesPrompt:{id:"rovo-chat.consumer-prompts.stay-on-top-of-my-work-prompt",defaultMessage:"Identify an important or recently updated work item. Start with a brief overview of your reasoning, then draft a succinct and friendly comment I can post to the team. Include key questions, flagged risks, and clear next steps. Keep response under 300 words.",description:"Prompt for dr